{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the shape and look of you cell, drag and drop attachments which impacts your stats and abilities.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>World</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Explore procedurally generated worlds, featuring diverse biomes with unique characteristics.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Game modes</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Relaxed</strong> - Progress is always saved.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Normal</strong> - Progress is only saved if you reach a checkpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\"><strong>Hardcore</strong> - If you die, you die forever.</p></li></ul>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520660?t=1744303612","background_raw":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3520660?t=1744303612","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520660/e1d18ef3b47ca4e293efbfa0d67db9c5755ec593/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1744303612","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3520660/e1d18ef3b47ca4e293efbfa0d67db9c5755ec593/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1744303612","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Steam Cloud","id":23},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Design your own single-celled organism and dive into a vast microscopic world. Eat, fight, and unlock upgrades to survive the dangerous microcosm. </p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\"><strong>Customization</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Customize the shape and look of you cell, drag and dr